<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_III__cl_15__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "No person shall carry on the activities involving animals as specified in the Schedule unless he holds a valid licence granted under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_III__cl_15__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_III__cl_15> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
