<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_III__cl_16__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Board may, after receiving an application for a licence under subsection (1), issue the licence or refuse to issue the licence."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_III__cl_16__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_III__cl_16> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
