<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chairman and four other members of the Board shall form a quorum at any meeting of the Board."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_12> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
