<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Where there is an equality of votes, the Chairman or the Deputy Chairman replacing the Chairman referred to in subsection (2) shall have the casting vote."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_12> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
