<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "The Board may invite any person to attend any meeting of the Board for the purpose of advising the Board on any matter under discussion, but the person so invited shall not be entitled to vote at the said meeting. Committees"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
