<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "An alternate member who attends the meetings of the Board shall, for all purposes, be deemed to be a member of the Board."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
