<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_IX__cl_64__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who, on the date of the coming into operation of this Act, is undertaking an activity to which this Act applies shall, within six months from the date of the coming into operation of this Act, apply for a licence under section 16 and such application shall be treated as a fresh application and not as an application for renewal of a licence."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
