<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_IX__cl_64__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Upon receipt of an application under subsection (1), the Board shall issue an acknowledgement of receipt to such person."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_IX__cl_64__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_IX__cl_64> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
