<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_50> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person guilty for a second or subsequent similar offence under this Act or any subsidiary legislation made under this Act shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not more than twice the original sum of fine for that offence or to imprisonment for a term not less than three months. Deprivation"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
