<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_55__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_55__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of this section, “item” means any things or substance in respect of which an offence has been committed and which is a subject matter in relation to the evidence necessary to establish the commission of the offence."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
