<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "An animal welfare officer shall have all the powers necessary to carry out an investigation of the commission of an offence under this Act or any subsidiary legislation made under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
