<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purpose of subsection (1), the Criminal Procedure Code [Act 593] shall apply and an animal welfare officer shall have all the powers as provided for under the Criminal Procedure Code to carry out an investigation. Search and seizure without warrant"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
