<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_VII__cl_42__subsec_2__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "open all parts of the conveyance for search and take all measures necessary to enable or facilitate the carrying out of the search as the animal welfare officer thinks necessary."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
