<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_VII__cl_42__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who contravenes subsection (2) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine of not less than ten thousand ringgit and not more than fifty thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not more than one year or to both. Power to seal premises or conveyance"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
