<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_VII__cl_46__subsec_2__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "the court is satisfied that it is not reasonably practicable to communicate with the owner or the licensee."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_VII__cl_46__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@/~part_VII__cl_46> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/19/eng@> .
